{
 "vo": [
  {
   "id": "n01",
   "who": "narrator",
   "t": 0.6,
   "text": "This is Sam's Mac. Sam runs a startup with four AI agents."
  },
  {
   "id": "n02",
   "who": "narrator",
   "t": 6.0,
   "text": "A coder, a marketer, a researcher and a designer. All working at once, in one pile of windows."
  },
  {
   "id": "n03",
   "who": "narrator",
   "t": 13.4,
   "text": "Who's doing what? Like every founder, Sam scrolls through logs."
  },
  {
   "id": "n04",
   "who": "narrator",
   "t": 19.4,
   "text": "Now watch what happens when Sam opens Deskmates."
  },
  {
   "id": "n05",
   "who": "narrator",
   "t": 27.0,
   "text": "Every agent gets its own computer. Maya's code goes to her desk. Priya's post to hers. Jonas's research to his. Ines's designs to hers."
  },
  {
   "id": "n06",
   "who": "narrator",
   "t": 36.8,
   "text": "And every agent gets a face."
  },
  {
   "id": "n07",
   "who": "narrator",
   "t": 48.9,
   "text": "So Sam can talk to the team, face to face."
  },
  {
   "id": "s01",
   "who": "sam",
   "t": 52.0,
   "text": "Okay team, standup!"
  },
  {
   "id": "s02",
   "who": "sam",
   "t": 54.9,
   "text": "Maya, show me the fix?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s03",
   "who": "sam",
   "t": 67.1,
   "text": "Jonas?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s06",
   "who": "sam",
   "t": 74.6,
   "text": "Ines, what about onboarding?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s04",
   "who": "sam",
   "t": 82.8,
   "text": "Version B. Ship it."
  },
  {
   "id": "n08",
   "who": "narrator",
   "t": 88.3,
   "text": "Then they get back to work, and they help each other."
  },
  {
   "id": "n09",
   "who": "narrator",
   "t": 93.0,
   "text": "Big steps still come to Sam first."
  },
  {
   "id": "s05",
   "who": "sam",
   "t": 95.3,
   "text": "Approve."
  },
  {
   "id": "n10",
   "who": "narrator",
   "t": 97.4,
   "text": "Every hour, task and dollar is on the record in Databricks, so Sam can just ask."
  },
  {
   "id": "n11",
   "who": "narrator",
   "t": 110.6,
   "text": "Deskmates. Your AI team, with a desk, a face, and a seat at the table."
  }
 ],
